(4928, 653, 'news-post-header', 'Alvarez & Marsal has bolstered its Transaction Advisory Group in Latin America with five new consultants, all poached from a Big Four rival. Adriano José Ponciano and Emerson Santana join from KPMG, Vitor Garcia and Sergio Quiñones previously served EY and Ancuta Huzum makes the move from Deloitte.'),
